  "title": "can you plan the integration of git commit history lookups into the development process and into our evidence system? The intent is to use it to reduce churn that comes from incorrectly understanding codebase state and where some existing code may be in place to fix other bugs. Basically, the development process should require a git commit search of any code that is identified to be changed so that the agent confirms it has context of the history of the code at that point.",
